s":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Very much the opposite of her name, Yuki is a very unlucky person. Her parents passed away when she was young, so she was raised by her grandparents. However, they too passed away upon her graduating high school. She loses hope after her boyfriend Shinohara Reiji- whom she perceived as her one and only instance of \"good luck\"- cut ties with her. Yuki was then taken in by Mochizuki Akira."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though she was greatly weakened because of Reiji dumping her, Yuki is usually a very resilient, strong and cheerful person. It's not like she's bad-looking, but since she has no interest in fashion whatsoever, she appears plain."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on translations of her official website profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22620"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db80a287ea360193edb278b76d01563f966be98ff0814865192bd6e0188c7630.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2d9ab18276d4363515e7750bb4641eff4591f58ce180d7c7f0aeae1486d08e7.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"手塚 りょうこ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58047","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c22621","characterName":"望月 輝","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c22621"},"originalCharacterName":"望月 輝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful young man who suggested Yuki to get her revenge on Reiji when she was at the height of despair. He even helps her become a \"Reiji's type\"; a beautiful, sexy woman. Yuki doesn't know why he wishes to help her so much..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on translations of his official website profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22621"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c4803fa376d9359ebdd768317dd986528af009a4e0ea564df44832f353b50ca5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fe87cec7cc07ddc1d397417e3bb7aa4a2c130f9b5263022fa7f8a3706d69cc67.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"魁皇 楽","creatorId":"vndb:s80","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s80","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s80","name":"柿原 徹也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58046","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c22622","characterName":"篠原 玲人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c22622"},"originalCharacterName":"篠原 玲人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a strong desire to join the elite, and only ever thinks about rising up the ranks in the company he works at. When Yuki and Reiji first started dating, he was kind to her, but as time went by, his treatment of her became callous and careless. He claimed that he needed money for various \"work reasons\", which resulted in Yuki working hard to support him. As soon as he was able to get engaged to his boss' daughter, he abruptly breaks things off with Yuki."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on translations of his official website profile."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22622"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/t